      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    credit_sales = 40000\n    cogs = 30000\n    accounts_receivable = 3000\n    beginning_inventory = 1500\n    ending_inventory = 2000\n    accounts_payable = 4000\n    period_days = 365\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    average_inventory = (beginning_inventory + ending_inventory) / 2\n    dio = (average_inventory / cogs) * period_days\n    dso = (accounts_receivable / credit_sales) * period_days\n    dpo = (accounts_payable / cogs) * period_days\n\n    cash_conversion_cycle = dio + dso - dpo\n    answer = round(cash_conversion_cycle, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
